# Jade Monolith's effect watches only for damage from the chosen source to the target creature (CR 609.7a, 614.1a). Bot1
# blocks Bot2's Fencing Ace (1/1 double strike) with Grizzly Bears and Balduvian Bears, targets Grizzly Bears and chooses the
# Ace. The Ace's first-strike damage goes to Balduvian Bears: not to the target, so it is dealt there and the effect is not
# used up (CR 609.7b). Its regular damage goes to Grizzly Bears, and that is redirected: the Ace deals it to Bot1 instead.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald x4
Jade Monolith
Grizzly Bears
Balduvian Bears
Island
Island x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Fencing Ace
Island x25

